OL,3,GNEWSAGallery celebrates city's people,
OL,4,Aplaces and sounds
OL,5,
OL,6,FA new gallery celebrating the people,
OL,7,Fplaces, sounds and experiences that
OL,8,Fhave shaped Birmingham since the 1950s
OL,9,Fis opening at Birmingham Museum & Art
OL,10,FGallery.
OL,12,FA City That Can opens on Tuesday, and
OL,13,Ftells the story of the city through the
OL,14,Feyes of Birmingham Museums' Citizens'
OL,15,FJury.
OL,23,APub: 06-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
