OL,3,GNEWSAGallery celebrates city's people,
OL,4,Aplaces and sounds
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe jury was commissioned by Birmingham
OL,7,FMuseums Trust in 2024 to challenge
OL,8,Fideas about who museums are for and
OL,9,Fwhat belongs in them. The exhibition
OL,10,Ffocuses not just on famous people and
OL,11,Fhistoric events, but on everyday lives,
OL,12,Fmemories and experiences.
OL,14,FIt explores some of the jury's
OL,15,Frecommendations through three themes:
OL,16,FBe Loud, Make Change and Play Hard.
